<section class="evolution-demo" aria-labelledby="evolution-title"><h2 id="evolution-title">复制与分化的基因树</h2><p>原理示意：一个祖先基因先复制，随后两个物种分化；假设四个拷贝均被保留。</p><div class="stage"><svg viewBox="0 0 720 260" role="img" aria-labelledby="evolution-svg-title evolution-desc"><title id="evolution-svg-title">基因复制后物种分化的示意树</title><desc id="evolution-desc">祖先基因 G 复制为 G1 和 G2，两支随后分别分化为甲乙物种中的基因拷贝。</desc><g fill="none" stroke="#8299a5" stroke-width="3"><path d="M100 130H200"/><path id="duplication-branches" d="M200 130H270V65H365 M270 130V195H365" opacity="0"/><path id="speciation-branches" d="M365 65H430V35H545 M430 65V95H545 M365 195H430V165H545 M430 195V225H545" opacity="0"/></g><g fill="#17324d" font-size="18"><text x="20" y="136">祖先 G</text><text id="duplication-label" x="215" y="155" opacity="0">复制</text><g id="terminal-labels" opacity="0"><text x="555" y="41">甲 G1</text><text x="555" y="101">乙 G1</text><text x="555" y="171">甲 G2</text><text x="555" y="231">乙 G2</text></g></g><circle cx="200" cy="130" r="7" fill="#197b73"/><g id="speciation-nodes" opacity="0" fill="#397ba0"><circle cx="430" cy="65" r="7"/><circle cx="430" cy="195" r="7"/></g></svg></div><p id="evolution-explanation" aria-live="polite"></p><div><button type="button" id="evolution-prev">上一步</button> <button type="button" id="evolution-next">下一步</button> <button type="button" id="evolution-reset">重置</button></div><p>绿色节点表示基因复制，蓝色节点表示物种分化；这是基因树的简化表示，实际基因丢失、后续复制和树的不确定性会改变判断。</p></section>
<script>
let evolutionStep=0;
const evolutionText=['第 1 步：从祖先基因 G 出发。','第 2 步：祖先谱系发生复制，形成 G1 和 G2 两支。','第 3 步：物种分化后，每个物种都保留两支；甲 G1 与乙 G1 的最近共同祖先是分化节点，属于直系同源。','第 4 步：甲 G1 与乙 G2 的最近共同祖先是复制节点，属于旁系同源；它们可以位于不同物种。'];
const showEvolution=()=>{const label=document.querySelector('#evolution-explanation');if(label)label.textContent=evolutionText[evolutionStep];for(const id of ['duplication-branches','duplication-label'])document.querySelector('#'+id)?.setAttribute('opacity',evolutionStep>=1?'1':'0');for(const id of ['speciation-branches','terminal-labels','speciation-nodes'])document.querySelector('#'+id)?.setAttribute('opacity',evolutionStep>=2?'1':'0');const prev=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#evolution-prev'),next=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#evolution-next');if(prev)prev.disabled=evolutionStep===0;if(next)next.disabled=evolutionStep===3;};
document.querySelector('#evolution-prev')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{evolutionStep=Math.max(0,evolutionStep-1);showEvolution()});document.querySelector('#evolution-next')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{evolutionStep=Math.min(3,evolutionStep+1);showEvolution()});document.querySelector('#evolution-reset')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{evolutionStep=0;showEvolution()});showEvolution();
</script>
<style>.evolution-demo{padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:#f8fbfa;border-radius:12px;margin:32px 0}.stage{overflow-x:auto}.stage svg{width:100%;min-width:620px;height:auto}.evolution-demo p{font-size:.9rem}.evolution-demo button{margin:4px}</style>
